    "updated_at": "2017-07-14T04:19:35Z",
    "body": "This part of the specification, like many others (e.g. anything having to do with UI, or downloads, etc.) is intentionally designed to give browsers leeway to work on providing their interpretation of the best user experience. I don't think we'll be imposing stricter standards here, as this kind of innovation is key in allowing browsers to differentiate themselves.\r\n\r\nI'm curious what @foolip thinks, as he's our go-to editor for media stuff.",
